fbc-b8e5-4655db14c17c_1408x768.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" fetchpriority="high"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><p>You think you know why the world keeps fighting.</p><p>One religion against another.<br>Faith versus science.<br>East versus West.<br>Ancient wisdom dismissed as myth while &#8220;serious&#8221; labs chase particles in the void.</p><p>But what if the fighting itself is the illusion?</p><p>What if every sacred tradition &#8212; from the worship of the Sun in Egypt to the three Abrahamic paths and the great Eastern lights of Buddhism and Hinduism &#8212; and every true science that refuses to be &#8220;Gritology&#8221; (<a href="https://clifhigh.substack.com/">Clif High&#8217;s</a> perfect word for the dead-matter, particle-grit worldview) are not rivals at all?</p><p>What if they are all fragments of <strong>one single remembering</strong>?</p><p>We have been here before.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IEYe!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb4c00920-51ca-40be-a3eb-69f74a457b8b_1408x768.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IEYe!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb4c00920-51ca-40be-a3eb-69f74a457b8b_1408x768.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IEYe!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb4c00920-51ca-40be-a3eb-69f74a457b8b_1408x768.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IEYe!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb4c00920-51ca-40be-a3eb-69f74a457b8b_1408x768.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IEYe!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb4c00920-51ca-40be-a3eb-69f74a457b8b_1408x768.png 1456w" sizes="100vw"><img src="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!IEYe!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb4c00920-51ca-40be-a3eb-69f74a457b8b_1408x768.png" width="1408" height="768" data-attrs="{&quot;src&quot;:&quot;https://substack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com/public/images/b4c00920-51ca-40be-a3eb-69f74a457b8b_1408x768.png&quot;,&quot;s