ine x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div></li><li><p><em><strong>Unit of Account</strong>: </em>As fiat dies, we&#8217;ll measure in grams/ounces for gold/silver and <strong>Sats</strong> (short for Satoshis) for Bitcoin. This mathematical truth anchors value in physics, not central bank whims.</p><p></p></li></ol><p>Now, the call to action: If you&#8217;re holding Bitcoin on an exchange like Coinbase, move it <em>today</em>. I learned this the hard way during the Celsius collapse&#8212;&#8221;Not your keys, not your coins&#8221; isn&#8217;t a slogan; it&#8217;s a survival rule. I lost access because I trusted a custodian. Don&#8217;t repeat my mistake. Self-custody is your path to liberty.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TDTs!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff687c43a-4ab5-4d76-a5a2-be34cde5cc53_1039x978.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TDTs!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff687c43a-4ab5-4d76-a5a2-be34cde5cc53_1039x978.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TDTs!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff687c43a-4ab5-4d76-a5a2-be34cde5cc53_1039x978.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TDTs!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff687c43a-4ab5-4d76-a5a2-be34cde5cc53_1039x978.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!TDTs!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressi