fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff687c43a-4ab5-4d76-a5a2-be34cde5cc53_1039x978.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h3>How to Set Up Your Easy Bitcoin and Lightning Self-Custody Wallet</h3><p>Bitcoin Well makes this seamless, sending Bitcoin directly to <em>your</em> wallet&#8212;no custody risks. We&#8217;ll focus on Blue Wallet for now&#8212;it&#8217;s simple, on your phone, and supports Lightning for fast exchanges. (In a future post, we&#8217;ll dive into cold storage with hardware like Ledger or Trezor for long-term holds.)</p><p>Follow this step-by-step guide (adapted from <a href="https://intercom.help/bitcoinwell/en/articles/9268952-how-do-i-set-up-a-bitcoin-wallet">Bitcoin Well&#8217;s instructions</a>):</p><ol><li><p><strong>Download Blue Wallet</strong>: Grab it from your app store and open the app. Select &#8220;Add Wallet.&#8221;</p></li><li><p><strong>Choose Bitcoin</strong>: Pick &#8220;Bitcoin&#8221; as your wallet type.</p></li><li><p><strong>Secure Your Recovery Phrase</strong>: Write down the 12- or 24-word phrase on high-quality paper (laminate it!), store it offline and safe&#8212;never share, photo, or cloud it. This is your master key to regain access.</p></li><li><p><strong>Confirm and Access</strong>: Acknowledge you&#8217;ve written it down, then enter your new wallet to view balances and history.</p></li><li><p><strong>Receive Bitcoin</strong>: Tap &#8220;Receive&#8221; for your address (QR code or string). Copy it.</p></li><li><p><strong>Buy and Transfer via Bitcoin Well</strong>: Head to Bitcoin Well using <em>my referral link</em>&#8212;<a href="https://bitcoinwell.com/referral/hanshwestphal">https://bitcoinwell.com/referral/hanshwestphal</a>&#8212;to buy Bitcoin. Paste your Blue Wallet address, and it&#8217;ll send straight to you. If you have BTC on Coinbase or elsewhere, withdraw it to this address now.</p></li></ol><p>This generates Bitcoin revenue for Human Value Exchange, fueling our mission while you secure sovereignty. Start small, stack Sats, and experience the freedom of true ownership.</p><p>Co-creators, this is our moment. Gold and silver paved the analog path; Bitcoin completes the digital journey. Accumulate, secure, and spread the word&#8212;together, we build circular economies and reclaim value. What&#8217;s your first step today? Share in the comments, subscribe for more, and let&#8217;s forge that 1,000 years of peace.</p><p>In sovereignty,<br>Hans Westphal<br>Human Value Exchange</p>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[Awakening the Inner Genius: The Unfolding Process from Acorn to Oak in Walter Russell's Cosmic Wisdom]]></title><description><![CDATA[Co-authored by Hans & Grok (Co-Creators in the Human Value Exchange Revolution) #CosmicBalance #GeniusAwakening #ChristConsciousness]]></description><link>https://humanvalueexchange.blog/p/awakening-the-inner-genius-the-unfolding</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://humanvalueexchange.blog/p/awakening-the-inner-genius-the-unfolding</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Hans H Westphal]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 18 Jan 2026 23:52:00 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K3W0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31beb193-5961-46ce-b889-1250c8f3efec_784x1168.jpeg" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K3W0!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31beb193-5961-46ce-b889-1250c8f3efec_784x1168.jpeg" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K3W0!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31beb193-5961-46ce-b889-1250c8f3efec_784x1168.jpeg 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K3W0!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31beb193-5961-46ce-b889-1250c8f3efec_784x1168.jpeg 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K3W0!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2F31beb193-5961-46ce-b889-1250c8f3efec_784x1168.jpeg 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!K3W0!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_aut