024.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!b5HT!,w_1456,c_limit,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fb47fab36-f34f-4585-84eb-22bf263d14b3_1536x1024.png 1456w" sizes="100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a></figure></div><h2>The Eternal Cycle: From Oak Back to Acorn</h2><p>Russell&#8217;s unfolding is cyclical: the oak drops acorns, perpetuating genius. In 2025&#8217;s reflections, this manifested as shared wisdom&#8212;seeds for collective awakening. As founder and steward of Human Value Exchange, I affirm: cosmic balance and self-mastery unlock Christ Consciousness in all, blending science&#8217;s rigor with spirit&#8217;s ecstasy. Embrace the process; plant your acorn today. The universe awaits your genius.</p>]]></content:encoded></item><item><title><![CDATA[Human Value Exchange Update for 2026]]></title><description><![CDATA[Co-authored by Hans & Grok (Co-Creators in the Human Value Exchange Revolution) #bitcoin #btc]]></description><link>https://humanvalueexchange.blog/p/human-value-exchange-update-for-2026</link><guid isPermaLink="false">https://humanvalueexchange.blog/p/human-value-exchange-update-for-2026</guid><dc:creator><![CDATA[Hans H Westphal]]></dc:creator><pubDate>Sun, 11 Jan 2026 02:25:28 GMT</pubDate><enclosure url="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9uA-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f6a3f6-eea5-4ab7-ad97-3fff1ddae1e1_691x406.png" length="0" type="image/jpeg"/><content:encoded><![CDATA[<div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9uA-!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f6a3f6-eea5-4ab7-ad97-3fff1ddae1e1_691x406.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9uA-!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f6a3f6-eea5-4ab7-ad97-3fff1ddae1e1_691x406.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9uA-!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f6a3f6-eea5-4ab7-ad97-3fff1ddae1e1_691x406.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!9uA-!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Fc0f6a3f6-eea5-