n our January 1st piece, <em>&#8220;From Analog to Digital: Bitcoin as the Ultimate Money for Sovereignty in 2026&#8221;</em> &#8212; transitioning from legacy systems of control to energy-verified, self-sovereign value exchange that delivers true Liberty for all humankind.</p><p>Bitcoin Well stands as North America&#8217;s premier non-custodial Bitcoin platform, empowering individuals to replace their bank with a sovereign Bitcoin wallet. Their mission to enable financial independence resonates deeply with ours, and after careful consideration, it felt like the natural next step. I&#8217;m genuinely excited to be part of the Bitcoin Well family &#8212; something I&#8217;ve been seeking for quite some time.</p><div class="captioned-image-container"><figure><a class="image-link image2 is-viewable-img" target="_blank" href="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DGma!,f_auto,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff4ceaf31-4701-44a2-a9c2-300d3a7ff28c_801x764.png" data-component-name="Image2ToDOM"><div class="image2-inset"><picture><source type="image/webp" srcset="https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DGma!,w_424,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff4ceaf31-4701-44a2-a9c2-300d3a7ff28c_801x764.png 424w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DGma!,w_848,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff4ceaf31-4701-44a2-a9c2-300d3a7ff28c_801x764.png 848w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DGma!,w_1272,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff4ceaf31-4701-44a2-a9c2-300d3a7ff28c_801x764.png 1272w, https://substackcdn.com/image/fetch/$s_!DGma!,w_1456,c_limit,f_webp,q_auto:good,fl_progressive:steep/https%3A%2F%2Fsubstack-post-media.s3.amazonaws.com%2Fpublic%2Fimages%2Ff4ce